ed, and the UV index. When you view the UV index, Then you will be presented with a color that indicates whether the conditions are favorable, moderate, or severe. When you view a future weather conditions for that city, Then  you will be  presented with a 5-day forecast that displays the date, an icon representation of weather conditions, the temperature, the wind speed, and the humidity. When you click on a city in the search history, Then you will be presented with current and future conditions for that city.","topics":[],"score":224704,"global_rank":157237},{"name":"teaguestockwell/game-feedback","owner":"teaguestockwell","html_url":"https://github.com/teaguestockwell/game-feedback","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Submit and review feedback for game sessions","topics":["docker","mysql","nextjs","prisma","react","react-query","zustand"],"score":224704,"global_rank":157239},{"name":"kashsomani/kashsomani.com-svelte-express","owner":"kashsomani","html_url":"https://github.com/kashsomani/kashsomani.com-svelte-express","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224704,"global_rank":157242},{"name":"AnthonyPatton/movie-finder","owner":"AnthonyPatton","html_url":"https://github.com/AnthonyPatton/movie-finder","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Movie finder app with search ability. ","topics":["material","reactjs"],"score":224704,"global_rank":157245},{"name":"JuanjoRamirez262/employee-tracker","owner":"JuanjoRamirez262","html_url":"https://github.com/JuanjoRamirez262/employee-tracker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224704,"global_rank":157246},{"name":"IkIsmailKhan/MySyara","owner":"IkIsmailKhan","html_url":"https://github.com/IkIsmailKhan/MySyara","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,